Started playing in original Quake. Shortly after he moved to [[QuakeWorld]], which became his favorite mod, because of its speed and physics.

Already in QuakeWorld, he was invited by [[Marlboro]] and [[Legi (br)]] to join [[Lords of War]]. After some time with them, some of '''LoW''' members became inactive, and he left.

He joined [[RS Terminators]] for a period. But he had interest into play with [[Quakers in Black]], and was invited by [[Boblast]] to join. Unfortunately, just like in his '''LoW''' times, many '''QiB''' members went inactive, and he decided to left.

Then he joined [[Pedreiro]] into forming [[Try Again]], and the clan became one of the top at the time, together with [[O Clan]] and [[Animaniacs]].

After some period of inactivity, he got back in 2008 and joined [[Animaniacs]], that still had many active members. But after 1 year he retired again.

In 2018 he returned to Quake, and reformed [[Try Again]] with some of the old members.

